"B<F_GETOWN> and B<F_SETOWN> are specified in POSIX.1-2001.  (To get their "
"definitions, define either B<_XOPEN_SOURCE> with the value 500 or greater, "
"or B<_POSIX_C_SOURCE> with the value 200809L or greater.)"
